WEBVTT

00:00:00.620 --> 00:00:04.050
Hey there — I'm Ava, and I'm not real.

00:00:04.050 --> 00:00:08.400
I'm a digital avatar created by AvatarAgency.

00:00:08.400 --> 00:00:13.420
When someone lands on this website, I'm the first one to say hello.

00:00:13.420 --> 00:00:17.120
I answer questions, I explain how everything works,

00:00:17.120 --> 00:00:20.800
and when you're ready, I can book a call with the team for you.

00:00:21.320 --> 00:00:26.500
So tell me — what brought you here today?
